All the thirty seven (37) tax returns can be filed by clicking the "SUBMIT" or "FINAL COPY" button and the taxpayer will receive the corresponding confirmation thru email notification. Taxpayers using this new version shall follow these simple and convenient steps: TCAScE

Step 1. DOWNLOAD, INSTALL and RUN eBIRForms Package Version 5.1;

Step 2. Complete the Profile page, select from the List of BIR Forms then click "Fill up". Accomplish the selected tax return by directly encoding data in it;

