Step 4. Click SUBMIT button:

4.1 If successful, taxpayer will be redirected to eBIRForms Login page and shall enter his/her/its Username and Password.

4.2 If unsuccessful, click FINAL COPY button to use an alternative mode of electronic submission and an email confirmation will be received by the taxpayer. For those who are not yet enrolled to the eBIRForms System, it is required to fully and unconditionally agree to the Terms of Service Agreement (TOSA).

